1011: 
1012: | Requirement | Technical Solution in `app/js/tmdb.js` |
1013: |---|---|
1014: | **Trending & Top Rated** | Clean parameterized methods `getTrending` & `getTopRated` with 30m–60m TTL caching. |
1015: | **Catalog Discover & Filters** | Flexible `discover(mediaType, params)` supporting genres, year, providers, sort, and pagination. |
1016: | **Content Details & Credits** | Single roundtrip query via `append_to_response=credits,recommendations,similar,images` with English ClearLogo extraction. |
1017: | **TV Seasons & Episode List** | `getTvSeason(tvId, seasonNumber)` parsing 16:9 still URLs, episode numbers, runtime, and synopsis. |
1018: | **Live Multi-Search** | `searchMulti(query, page)` with instant empty query short-circuit and person filtering. |
1019: | **Wing Lists Integration** | `getWingLists()` & `getWingListItems(slug)` parsing editorial collections and ratings. |
1020: | **Image Resolution & Fallbacks**| `getPosterUrl`, `getBackdropUrl`, `getStillUrl`, `getProfileUrl` with vector SVG data URIs and cycle-proof `handleImageError`. |
1021: | **1.5GB RAM Safety Cap** | Strict 100-entry LRU/TTL cache storing only normalized, pruned models (~350KB total footprint). |
1022: | **Network Reliability** | `AbortController` 8000ms timeout with Stale-While-Revalidate fallback. |
1023: | **Deterministic Testing** | Built-in offline mock mode (`setMockMode`) and fixture registry matching all UI elements. |
1024: | **Global Export** | Global `window.TmdbClient` and Node.js `module.exports` compatibility. |
